<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-26T12:56:39.717Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:56:39 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Somali federal forces and U.S. airstrikes have recently killed dozens of al-Shabaab militants in Lower Shabelle, while Turkish-made missiles were identified in a deadly Somalia airstrike. The Somali parliament speaker has accused Kenya, Ethiopia and Uganda of colluding with al-Shabaab, and the president has blamed the UAE for financing armed groups. The United States has reversed its funding for international military support to Somalia. Al-Shabaab is reported to be collaborating with Houthi forces, raising concerns for global trade. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168874&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9BZ1BZd1ZUVElkZnJFNXAtV2RwT1hfMUlGejUwekRUSVZVWEhKQ0dCWDlJN2J6aGU0dWhrbE1KcHhaOEZrblJ3eWRMYVlxRnBCNXFsWlBCVmkzcHVkU0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOY0dyaTRNZXgtS2lrc0l0c001WEpYdXp5OUowWEx3QU9ZRXViZVh1UGZQaERtOTRuZGZ0TzJZeTZoUmtxOE00TERiR0VQUlRQamFJYVZ1dU5UWFlSNzZfMGVTTlQxWXRFMXk2MXplZVFTUmhqS0lzVlRhRkVDQ2t2cXZzak5SYmhfNW91YXVTd0ZKaGlNRS05NlNsU2gxWmNENEg4R2psaGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE80LV94STM1SUl4STJUdTFIakJwZkItTGtuR2ExaUJUM3BZUjA5YkhuR21oRFVaM2REVndTMGhIWDVObE5VWnNyVWVITTBtalFDQ3lzXzY0YWxaUDJSVEtnWDlDejBkUHJieDBn?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxPenpRQzVnUkhOcUJGSDNsVkhlYWlRNGFJR3hsWHk3VlBFM3RyWWE5SWE5M0NDWmhwVlZfMDZFTGNrT0J6ZWJfRmp0OGJuNHFNZHBUckhNVXNuOUNac3NjNzRZOXYtRUswS3RTVXFOMTc0LXJIMTdyTnJkbHpDcDEzRE9IdUc1RmhZRkJodmR4NDR2Vjl2dHFGazh0Z0